\ hypothesis, of type a ≤ b, which the goal b ≤ a does not take: 96.
\ Lean: theorem w_hv_this (a b : Nat) (h : a ≤ b) : b ≤ a := by
\         have := h
\         exact this
theorem w_hv_this
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b
  a b ≤ explicit: h
